      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "blue = control plane (Raft between managers too)\npurple = membership + overlay state (gossip)\norange = container-to-container traffic (VXLAN)\ngreen = the ONLY port meant for outsiders",
