      "updated": 1794563133707,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Workers start the 2377 connection to a manager, so a worker behind NAT can join. 7946 and 4789 are symmetric: any node may start them. Tested: a manager listens on\n2377/tcp, 7946/tcp+udp and 4789/udp.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "b21",
      "originalText": "Workers start the 2377 connection to a manager, so a worker behind NAT can join. 7946 and 4789 are symmetric: any node may start them. Tested: a manager listens on 2377/tcp, 7946/tcp+udp and 4789/udp.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
